1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,977
The Sacred Groves: the gods are furious with the tourists, and they've made a pact

2
00:00:03,977 --> 00:00:04,695
with the Killer.

3
00:00:04,915 --> 00:00:06,664
Here's how the location plays.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:11,432
Put the Divine Wrath card out with a tracking marker on level two, and line the

5
00:00:11,432 --> 00:00:14,369
Sacred Groves Bloodlust track up beside the Killer's board.

6
00:00:14,589 --> 00:00:18,992
Set the Finale token aside, and add both Atonement cards to the Action Tableau.

7
00:00:18,992 --> 00:00:20,776
They come in the Inkanyamba box.

8
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:26,058
Divine Wrath is the gods' anger. Increase and Decrease move the marker on the Divine

9
00:00:26,058 --> 00:00:28,128
Wrath card, always between one and ten.

10
00:00:28,348 --> 00:00:30,929
Unleash means apply whatever the current level says.

11
00:00:31,733 --> 00:00:35,760
Whenever Bloodlust rises, also apply the matching line on the Sacred Groves

12
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:36,619
Bloodlust track.

13
00:00:36,839 --> 00:00:39,747
If the Finale is revealed, put the Finale token on it.

14
00:00:39,747 --> 00:00:44,163
Each Killer phase, after the Killer Action, Unleash Divine Wrath, then increase it

15
00:00:44,163 --> 00:00:44,540
by one.

16
00:00:45,367 --> 00:00:49,052
The Burial Ground, Sacred Shrine and Holy Groves are Sacred spaces.

17
00:00:49,052 --> 00:00:52,407
The more Victims on them, the more likely Divine Wrath rises.

18
00:00:52,627 --> 00:00:55,507
Atonement Action cards are your main way to bring it down.

19
00:00:56,333 --> 00:01:00,579
A few tips. Keep Victims off the Sacred spaces to stop Divine Wrath climbing.

20
00:01:00,799 --> 00:01:04,905
The Setup card matters here: there's a big win-rate gap between the easiest and

21
00:01:04,905 --> 00:01:05,321
hardest.

22
00:01:05,541 --> 00:01:08,083
Barbara's extra health helps you hit hard early.

23
00:01:08,083 --> 00:01:11,472
It's one of the hardest locations in logged games, so good luck.

